  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In a September 17, 2025 opening statement, Ethan Klein said OSTP could lead the United States to global dominance in AI and other critical and emerging technologies. In the same statement, he said emerging technologies promise economic opportunity, public health, and national security benefits, while policy discourse had at times leaned too far toward restraint and slowed progress. He also described OSTP under Director Kratsios as having authored America’s AI Action Plan and assisted the President with executive orders to promote artificial intelligence, accelerate nuclear energy, and spur advanced aviation. In a February 6, 2026 reported statement, Klein referred to what he called an “overly burdensome” regulatory regime.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
    "s4",
    "s3"
   ],
